        "TileImage": "$($repository 7da7595f-0309-45ee-9f8e-48abffde613d).Image",
        "Description": "It seems the people who kiddnapped 47 are further outreaching than we thought. They have once again captured him, but this time, forgot to implant a way to dispose of him. However, they still have trackers in their clothes, so disguises are not an option. We have located 4 targets who each have info about the leader&apos;s whereabouts. Get that info, and get out.\r\r(Thanks for checking this out! For the best experience, I suggest the Keep starting location, and once again, please don&apos;t bring any items",
